<title>BELGIUM: EU to send 4,500 T wheat flour aid to Madagascar.</title>
<headline>EU to send 4,500 T wheat flour aid to Madagascar.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union will deliver 4,500 tonnes of common wheat flour to Madagascar free at the port of destination, the EU Official Journal said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The food aid tender was awarded to Hamburg-based Alfred C. Toepfer at a price of 309.90 Ecus a tonne.</p>
<p>--Brussels Bureau +322 287 6830</p>
